ir, dye, accessory, customization option you have to pay for. Almost nothing nice looking is free except some login rewards. Skip this one or look into when they have a free character giveaway and try it out then.", "timestamp_created": 1745345232, "timestamp_updated": 1745345232, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.452007591724395752", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193348939", "author": {"steamid": "76561198854085910", "personaname": "dickleMCPicklemebob69", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198854085910/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 25117, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 16564, "last_played": 1754956656, "avatar": "9b5b29b32f656106b7446373be91a78590cc28a8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Blair is him", "timestamp_created": 1745341924, "timestamp_updated": 1745341924, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.468085110187530518", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}]}